flowchart TD
  subgraph Author[Author implementations and released assets]
    BC[Flow BC24 policy]
    Prior[Catcher archive: 1,011,008 complete-episode rows]
    Learner[RealTimeEXPOFTLearner and original training driver]
    Sampler[Original AsyncChunkSampler]
    Eval[Original evaluation driver and full-state restore]
  end
  subgraph Sadhana[Sadhana: harness and explicit Catcher integration]
    Root[Coordinator: source, configuration and process checks]
    Adapter[Catcher state-policy backend and task adapter]
    Native[CPU Kinetix world: observations, actions, rewards]
    Replay[Original offline and online replay]
    Saved[Finalized learner checkpoint at index 4096]
    Recovery[CPU artifact recovery: trace, replay, optimizer and RNG checks]
    Frozen[Four CPU frozen trials on one level]
    Review[Independent agents: source and artifact review]
    Viewer[Results viewer: complete videos and actual update counts]
  end
  Root -->|bounded GPU0 launch| Learner
  BC -->|initial policy parameters| Adapter
  Prior -->|offline transitions| Replay
  Adapter -->|declared model and task interface| Learner
  Learner -->|slow action inference and fast correction| Sampler
  Sampler -->|delayed action chunks| Native
  Native -->|observations and labelled transitions| Replay
  Replay -->|original sampling and update schedule| Learner
  Learner -->|author save and exit0| Saved
  Saved -->|immutable artifact; client shutdown SIGINT disclosed| Recovery
  Root -->|resource release and recovery acceptance| Recovery
  Review -->|independent evidence checks| Recovery
  Recovery -->|accepted parameters, clocks and RNG| Eval
  Eval -->|no updates; original action path| Frozen
  Frozen -->|full episode traces, outcomes and videos| Viewer
  Review -->|source, media and presentation checks| Viewer
  subgraph Planned[Planned transfer and scaling study]
    Data[Atlas and Engram: published curated data]
    Leela[Leela: published R1 Lite simulation and reset contract]
    Study[Matched new-data and collection-policy experiments]
  end
  Data -. proposed artifact handoff .-> Leela
  Leela -. reward and action contracts required .-> Study
  Recovery -. method integration evidence only .-> Study
